Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.54,0:04:19.62,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}今後沒有伙伴陪伴的日子  孤獨到令人恐懼
Dialogue: 4,0:04:19.62,0:04:24.78,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}即便如此  命運仍在我身且無法抗拒
Dialogue: 4,0:04:24.78,0:04:28.98,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}「都是你的錯  全都是你的錯」別再指責了
Dialogue: 4,0:04:28.98,0:04:31.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}早已理解一切  早已看透一切
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.48,0:04:34.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}我這死前掙扎的模樣  十分可笑呢 ^_^
Dialogue: 4,0:04:34.48,0:04:39.13,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}把世界劇本斬碎  將必定結局吞嚥
Dialogue: 4,0:04:39.30,0:04:44.03,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}假裝理解  遵從內心
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.68,0:04:57.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}演奏未來  正如你願
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.38,0:05:02.23,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}盡情讚頌  獲得經驗
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.23,0:05:04.03,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}面對煩惱
Dialogue: 4,0:05:04.03,0:05:06.78,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}打破規則
Dialogue: 4,0:05:06.78,0:05:09.13,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}現在之事  唯我行動
Dialogue: 4,0:05:09.13,0:05:11.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}自己之事  唯我知曉
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.48,0:05:16.13,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}{\blur5\bord0\c&H000000&}定將守護  你的一切
